PLACEHOLDER - DO NOT SHIP. This is not the maintainer's release key.

It is a throwaway P-256 key generated only so that //go:embed has a file to
compile against. Its private half was never written anywhere and nobody kept
it, so this key can never verify a real release: while it is the only key
embedded here, every 'lnpm update' will refuse to install.

Replace this file's contents with the maintainer's real public key before
cutting a signed release. Keep the filename - SECURITY.md tells users to fetch
this exact path to verify a download by hand.

